      <activity id="eaf5121a-efce-5be0-9e17-d1d1bb594e08" activityNameId="fb8fbcf6-44cf-511c-b03f-ca0d4d681dff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation system, Geschäftshaus B, Esslingen, various components</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilation system, Geschäftshaus B, Esslingen, various components
Disposal of various components for a ventilation system for an office building with offices only (no kitchen, restaurant or car park). The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 2472 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 5700 m3/h, total weight of the components: 351 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 2.3 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for air valves, air intake, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers and sensors.;
UUID: 8b7af501-6c2f-4011-9b6c-9cf8ffd090ea
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8b7af501-6c2f-4011-9b6c-9cf8ffd090ea.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
